<http://batterydata.commons/dataset/bdc_000250> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This record describes the only public experimental-data repository currently listed by the official HVES Battery Testing Consortium GitHub organisation: LG-HG2. The consortium profile also lists eleven other cell products, but those rows are a membership catalogue rather than eleven public datasets, so they are not duplicated here as downloadable cell variants. Appendix A of the official BTC protocol allocates LG HG2 cell identifiers 1–12; direct inspection of the current public repository tree finds experimental directories for cells 1–7, 9 and 10 only, so the specimen count is nine and the planned count of twelve is retained separately. The earlier fixed sampling value of 1 s was removed because logging is test-dependent. The repository requires a −1.5 °C correction to thermocouple readings from tests dated before 2021-09-25. The BTC User Agreement identifies the data licence as CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 and adds degree-only, no-redistribution and other consortium-specific use conditions; users should read that agreement before reuse."@en .
